WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.060
IRIS: The file you're going into is Boston.

2
00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:04.360
June, 1774.

3
00:00:05.182 --> 00:00:07.732
A harbour town, occupied and cornered,

4
00:00:07.802 --> 00:00:11.152
a long standing argument
with the Crown is escalating.

5
00:00:21.172 --> 00:00:24.192
Before I field you, we'll go through
how it came to this,

6
00:00:24.272 --> 00:00:26.432
then you will receive your mission.
